From: Ifran Ali <khanu.i.i.k.2000@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH 902/903] soc: zte: add the ZX279125 GPON MAC driver

Add hardware GPON MAC controller and optical transceiver telemetry driver
for the ZTE Sanechips ZX279125 SoC, implementing ITU-T G.984 state machine
management and integration with the Linux xPON subsystem.

Signed-off-by: Ifran Ali <khanu.i.i.k.2000@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/soc/Kconfig  | 1 +
 drivers/soc/Makefile | 1 +
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+)

--- a/drivers/soc/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/soc/Kconfig
@@ -31,5 +31,6 @@ source "drivers/soc/ux500/Kconfig"
 source "drivers/soc/versatile/Kconfig"
 source "drivers/soc/vt8500/Kconfig"
 source "drivers/soc/xilinx/Kconfig"
+source "drivers/soc/zte/Kconfig"
 
 endmenu
--- a/drivers/soc/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/soc/Makefile
@@ -37,3 +37,4 @@ obj-$(CONFIG_ARCH_U8500)	+= ux500/
 obj-y				+= versatile/
 obj-y				+= vt8500/
 obj-y				+= xilinx/
+obj-y				+= zte/
